{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10641030","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10641030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1064103001:1":{"text":"好饿……幸好晚餐时剩下了一些面包。","source_cn":"好饿……幸好晚餐时剩下了一些面包。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EBE7DF316D3178F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1064103002:1":{"text":"月色多么皎洁啊……如果没有发生那桩惨案，本该是宁静的一夜……","source_cn":"月色多么皎洁啊……如果没有发生那桩惨案，本该是宁静的一夜……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF85CE4493D61EA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064103003:1":{"text":"咔吱——","source_cn":"咔吱——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38B6C7D979833F3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064103004:1":{"text":"……奇怪，哪里来的声音？","source_cn":"……奇怪，哪里来的声音？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x089B07C3B7B5F758","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:8::0":{"text":"橱柜","source_cn":"橱柜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FEF9F894DC6E389","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064103005:1":{"text":"好像是从那只橱柜里传出来的。难道有老鼠在偷吃？","source_cn":"好像是从那只橱柜里传出来的。难道